    "key_features_Vnj8Rk": {
      "type": "key-features",
      "blocks": {
        "feature_37gXEm": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Sketching_a_Timeless_Ring_Design_1.png",
            "bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Step 1: Design Your Dream Piece",
            "text": "<p>The custom design process can begin however you prefer—by email, phone, in-person or a one-on-one virtual consultation with our Milano design team. Whether you bring us inspiration through words, sketches, photos, links, or even an existing piece of jewelry, our team will carefully listen to your vision and needs. From this conversation, we’ll be able to understand your style and provide you with a precise, tailored quote.<br/><br/></p>",
            "show_segments": true,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "1",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_LF9aLR": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/KR-8136-CAD_398ac24c-8074-4651-acb3-e6d15c383b05.jpg",
            "bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Step 2: Approve the Design & Quote",
            "text": "<p>We’ll collaborate with you to create a ring you truly love—crafted to your vision while staying within your desired budget. After finalizing any adjustments, and once you’ve approved the design and quote, we’ll provide a secure custom link so you can complete your purchase directly on our website.</p>",
            "show_segments": true,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "2",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_Qqmhwd": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/KR-8136-Y4_cb647674-5181-4cd9-b114-218d3cccb5d0.jpg",
            "bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Step 3: Approving Final 3D Rendering",
            "text": "<p>Once your custom design is finalized, our team will provide detailed 3D renderings or wax model photos within a few days, allowing you to review every angle and ensure every detail is exactly as you envisioned.</p>",
            "show_segments": true,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "3",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_9iRY8V": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Casting.png",
            "bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Step 4: Crafting Your Idea",
            "text": "<p>With your final approval, the journey from vision to reality begins. Your design is first cast and then carefully refined by one of our skilled artisans. Each diamond or gemstone is hand-set under a microscope to ensure flawless precision, followed by meticulous polishing and finishing to bring out its brilliance. While our master craftsmen bring your idea to life, all you need to do is sit back and look forward to the moment your custom jewelry is ready to shine.</p>",
            "show_segments": true,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "4",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_jmH8Xt": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-photo-6263113.jpg",
            "bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "bg_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Step 5: Enjoy Your Creation",
            "text": "<p>The countdown to your one-of-a-kind ring begins. Within two to three weeks, your bespoke piece will be on its way to you via secure FedEx delivery. Before it leaves our hands, every ring undergoes a meticulous quality inspection under a microscope to ensure it meets Milano’s exacting standards of craftsmanship and brilliance. Once it passes our final checks, your jewelry is carefully packaged and prepared for its journey to you. To keep your jewelry shining for years to come, we’ll also provide care instructions so your piece retains the same sparkle as the day it was crafted.</p>",
            "show_segments": true,
            "segments": 5,
            "active_segment": "5",
            "fill_segments": true,
            "show_labels": true,
            "label_left": "",
            "label_middle": "",
            "label_right": "",
            "show_icon": false,
            "icon": "star"
          }
        },
        "feature_HhRVCF": {
