            "text_color": "#505050",
            "heading": "Start Designing Your Custom Jewelry",
            "text": "<h2><a href=\"https://outlook.office.com/book/VirtualAppointment@milanodg.com/?ismsaljsauthenabled\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://outlook.office.com/book/VirtualAppointment@milanodg.com/?ismsaljsauthenabled\"><strong>GET STARTED</strong><br/></a></h2>",
